        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-S03-T2-V",
        "achievement": "Preserve 594 scientific tests and four Math regressions; verify real preview.10 NuGet bytes/SHA through five independent eight-probe consumers."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-S03-T2",
        "achievement": "Qualify explicit uniform timing and conservative numerical boundary audits with nonpartial outcomes and no implicit resampling."
      },
      {
